================================================================================
Attribution
================================================================================

dotnet-matplotlib is an independent, native .NET re-implementation (port) of
Matplotlib. Its public API surface, architecture (Figure/Axes/Artist/Transform/
Backend), default styling, color tables, and numerical conventions are modeled
on Matplotlib.

Matplotlib is distributed under a permissive PSF-based license which grants the
right to prepare derivative works provided the Matplotlib Development Team's
copyright notice is retained:

    "Copyright (c) 2012- Matplotlib Development Team; All Rights Reserved"
    "Copyright (c) 2002-2011 John D. Hunter; All Rights Reserved"

The full Matplotlib license is available upstream at
https://github.com/matplotlib/matplotlib/blob/main/LICENSE/LICENSE. A summary
of the changes made relative to Matplotlib (as required by clause 3 of that
license) is maintained in PORTING.md.
